{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんみさみさ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/29/2513849/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今朝こんな夢を見ました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんごがキムチ漬けよって\nみさもそれを手伝いよった夢！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「これやったらうちでも作れんねん！」\nってめっちゃ笑顔で言ってた（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日 本人に話したら\nみさみさの夢に出れて光栄やわ〜\nって(-∀-)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/29/2513849/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいっ。（笑）\nこんなスタートですが\n今日もみさブロはじまりま〜す"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私達のデビューシングル\nぐるぐるカーテンのカップリング曲\n「左胸の勇気」が\nスカパー！Jリーグ２０１２の\n公式ソングに決定しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/29/2513849/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/29/2513849/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Jリーグということで\n昨日の衣装はユニフォームなんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃーんっ！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/29/2513849/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうですか〜っ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/29/2513849/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似合ってるかなぁ(*^^*)？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさ本当に\nスポーツ観戦が大好きなんです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特に球技は全部＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/29/2513849/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学の時はバレー部だったし\n野球は兄と弟がずっとしているし\nバスケも体育でよくしていたし\nテニスも卓球も好きだし ←\n( 卓球は 東京1人暮らしの番組で\nお見せしました )笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サッカーも、もちろんですっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/29/2513849/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スポーツってどんなものでも\n素敵ですよね(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回 オフィシャルサポーターとして\nスカパー！Ｊリーグ2012を\n応援させていただきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっとサッカーのこと\n詳しく勉強したいって思ったし\n早く試合もみてみんなで応援したい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんもぜひ、私達と一緒に\n応援しましょうっ٩꒰ ๑′◡͐`꒱"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/29/2513849/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このユニホーム可愛すぎて\nすっごいテンション上がって\nみんなでいっぱい写真撮ったから\nなくなるまで毎回貼っていきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/29/2513849/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はこれっ！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/29/2513849/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヘンガオ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/29/2513849/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして出ました〜っ\n永島せいらっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒にヘンガオしよっていったのに\n自分だけキメたけんなー(￣ー￣)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさかの裏切りー(￣ー￣)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"彼女いわく\n「タイミングを逃した」らしい。\nニヤ〜ニヤしながら言ってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ、らりんは\nみさのことが大好きだからね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/29/2513849/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから許すとします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/29/2513849/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなよりも、好きかもよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今はレッスンおわって\nまいやんこと白石麻衣ちゃん\nまいまいこと深川麻衣ちゃん\nと みさみさで ラジオ\nレコメン！に出演してきます(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"24：00頃〜の出演です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/29/2513849/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"iPhoneからも聴けるそうなので\nお出かけしてる方もぜひ\n聴いてください(o^^o)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/29/2513849/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では！\n行ってきみさみさ！！！\nみんな聴いてよー？"}],"source":"archive"}